Audio Duration: 4m 8.4s (248.42s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 12:49:25 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,420] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 为什么你一直在赚钱
Segment #2   [00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:03,080] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 10 | Text: 就永远过着很穷和的生活
Segment #3   [00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,860] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 12 | Text: 因为这个社会的设计就是这么的精巧
Segment #4   [00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:10,020] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 15 | Text: 如果不去刻意抵制某种生活方式的诱惑
Segment #5   [00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:11,440] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 5  | Text: 或者说教训吧
Segment #6   [00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,160] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 8  | Text: 作为一个打工人来说
Segment #7   [00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,440] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 10 | Text: 输入再多也剩不下来什么
Segment #8   [00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:19,120] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 13 | Text: 资本跟社会就是会不断的告诉我们大家
Segment #9   [00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,340] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 5  | Text: 如何生活 如何消费
Segment #10  [00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:23,860] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 11 | Text: 这个系统就希望去做一个消费者
Segment #11  [00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,660] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 8  | Text: 做一个左手进右手出
Segment #12  [00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:28,160] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 11 | Text: 存不下任何资产的消费者
Segment #13  [00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,100] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 11 | Text: 你看那个出租车司机一天金属
Segment #14  [00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,100] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 6  | Text: 也要打几百万
Segment #15  [00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:34,720] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 13 | Text: 那小饭店一月流水也得十几万
Segment #16  [00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,300] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是那不是属于他们的钱
Segment #17  [00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,780] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 12 | Text: 事实上每一个无法利用规则的人
Segment #18  [00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:43,260] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 10 | Text: 都会成为规则下的NPC
Segment #19  [00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:44,820] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 3  | Text: 你的一切
Segment #20  [00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:48,240] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 17 | Text: 一切的代价和需求都会被计算的清清楚楚
Segment #21  [00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:50,760] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 9  | Text: 出租车司机的分子钱
Segment #22  [00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:52,560] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 8  | Text: 外卖选隔的客栏价
Segment #23  [00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:55,060] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 9  | Text: 餐饮老板的平台抽点
Segment #24  [00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:56,960] | Elapsed:  43.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 互联网大厂
Segment #25  [00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,520] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 那些高薪的人才
Segment #26  [00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:00,220] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 同样背着高额的房贷
Segment #27  [00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:02,600] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 各种天意无缝的设计
Segment #28  [00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,660] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 10 | Text: 会利用你现阶段的需求
Segment #29  [00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:05,960] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 把你的生活属于平
Segment #30  [00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:07,700] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 7  | Text: 正好卡在刚刚好
Segment #31  [00:01:08,260 --> 00:01:08,940] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 多一点少一点
Segment #32  [00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:09,920] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 3  | Text: 刚刚好
Segment #33  [00:01:10,460 --> 00:01:13,560] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 12 | Text: 能够存活差一点就崩溃的状态
Segment #34  [00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:16,580] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 13 | Text: 那除非你有勇气跳出游戏的规则
Segment #35  [00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:18,440] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 5  | Text: 重新审视自己
Segment #36  [00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:20,520] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 找出新的道路
Segment #37  [00:01:20,520 --> 00:01:22,240] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 11 | Text: 否则你只能在这种规则下
Segment #38  [00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:23,160] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 不断的服求
Segment #39  [00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:26,680] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 不断的焦虑
Segment #40  [00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:27,560] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 不断的自闭
Segment #41  [00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:29,460] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 10 | Text: 你但是对于大多数人来说
Segment #42  [00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:30,000] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 这种机会
Segment #43  [00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,720] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 8  | Text: 其实我感觉是非常少的
Segment #44  [00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:35,420] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 11 | Text: 作为一个被精算过的生活成本
Segment #45  [00:01:35,420 --> 00:01:36,840] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 8  | Text: 被系统压榨的NPC
Segment #46  [00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,760] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 9  | Text: 这就是人在一生的宿命
Segment #47  [00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,860] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个系统由市场产生
Segment #48  [00:01:41,860 --> 00:01:43,100] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 由资本操控
Segment #49  [00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:46,220] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 9  | Text: 由无数个聪明的头脑
Segment #50  [00:01:46,220 --> 00:01:48,400] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 11 | Text: 在千百个行业里各自设计
Segment #51  [00:01:49,020 --> 00:01:50,140] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 并且逐渐
